  "description": "Task-aligned supervised data for fine-tuning Gemma 4 E2B on Rakshak AI. Alert and brief examples are synthetic, written in IMD/CWC/GSI style; survival answers are grounded in NDMA/WHO/NDRF notes. Covers alert->action JSON, Hindi/English distress intent parsing, grounded survival RAG, and situation briefs. Prompts match lib/services/ai_engine.dart exactly.",
